# ─── Contact form (Formspree) ───────────────────────────────────
# The contact form posts directly to Formspree. The form ID is baked into
# the client bundle by default, so this variable is only needed if you
# want to point staging or a fork at a different Formspree form.
#
# Find your form ID at https://formspree.io → Forms → endpoint URL.
# It's the last segment of https://formspree.io/f/<FORM_ID>.
#
# Default (production form): mqenkkyv
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ID=
